  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>末影邮件</strong></span></p>\n<p>末影邮件允许你雇佣末影人作为末影邮差，为你在世界各地的任何地方递送包裹。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>功能特性</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>制作包裹并将需要递送的物品放入其5个物品栏中</li>\n<li>使用邮票标记包裹以设定递送位置</li>\n<li>手持包裹控制器右键点击以召唤末影邮差递送你的包裹</li>\n<li>蹲下时右键点击已标记的包裹可移除邮票并访问其中的物品</li>\n<li>包裹可作为保留内部物品的实体被拾取</li>\n<li>包裹也可以通过唯一ID递送至储物柜</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>图片展示</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rQ7FnLO.png\" alt=\"放置在世界的包裹\" width=\"1043\" height=\"652\"></p>\n<p><em>一个放置在世界中的包裹</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/X0T9cmk.png\" alt=\"邮票设置界面\" width=\"1043\" height=\"652\"></p>\n<p><em>邮票设置界面（Y轴坐标可以留空）</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/31KCDKg.png\" alt=\"已盖邮票的包裹\" width=\"1043\" height=\"652\"></p>\n<p><em>盖好邮票后的包裹</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zsPB5UC.png\" alt=\"拾取已盖邮票包裹的末影邮差\" width=\"1043\" height=\"652\"></p>\n<p><em>被召唤来递送包裹的末影邮差</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CJfkEN3.png\" alt=\"末影邮差递送后的已盖邮票包裹\" width=\"1043\" height=\"652\"></p>\n<p><em>末影邮差成功递送后的包裹</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Gsuaook.png\" alt=\"收到包裹后的储物柜\" width=\"1043\" height=\"652\"></p>\n<p><em>收到递送包裹后的储物柜</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>合成配方</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jGPzONn.png\" alt=\"邮票（不限形状）\" width=\"451\" height=\"216\"></p>\n<p><em>邮票（不限形状）</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VXL22AZ.png\" alt=\"包装胶带（不限形状）\" width=\"451\" height=\"215\"></p>\n<p><em>包装胶带（不限形状）</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OOBS8Mi.png\" alt=\"包裹（不限形状）\" width=\"450\" height=\"217\"></p>\n<p><em>包裹（不限形状）</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/WWzoTbx.png\" alt=\"包裹控制器\" width=\"450\" height=\"215\"></p>\n<p><em>包裹控制器</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/S6PIfYq.png\" alt=\"储物柜\" width=\"450\" height=\"215\"></p>\n<p><em>储物柜</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>Mod整合包</strong></span></p>\n<p>是的，你可以在你的Mod整合包中使用此模组。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>支持</strong></span></p>\n<p>如果你喜欢这个模组并希望支持该项目，欢迎通过 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fcgi-bin%252fwebscr%253freturn%253dhttps%253a%252f%252fwww.curseforge.com%252fprojects%252f374771%2526cn%253dAdd%2bspecial%2binstructions%2bto%2bthe%2baddon%2bauthor()%2526business%253dmattczyr%2540gmail.com%2526bn%253dPP-DonationsBF%253abtn_donateCC_LG.gif%253aNonHosted%2526cancel_return%253dhttps%253a%252f%252fwww.curseforge.com%252fprojects%252f374771%2526lc%253dUS%2526item_name%253dEnder%2bMail%2b(from%2bcurseforge.com)%2526cmd%253d_donations%2526rm%253d1%2526no_shipping%253d1%2526currency_code%253dUSD\" rel=\"nofollow\">PayPal进行捐赠</a>。非常感谢你的支持！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>赞助商</strong></span></p>\n<p>本项目由BisectHosting赞助。如果你正在寻找服务器主机，<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fchaos\" rel=\"nofollow\">查看他们的托管方案</a>，结账时使用优惠码 <em>Chaos</em> 即可在首月享受八折优惠（立减25%）！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fchaos\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/0998de1c-6d3e-4370-a553-0da42e986c68.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p>",
